[[12,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/79490\">See in Op. 5530B10 BATTERY - R.R.</a></p><p>- Make sure that the ignition key is in the OFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><p><a href=\"#/187410\">See in Op. 1072B42 INTAKE MANIFOLDS (all) - R.R. and Replace gasket</a></p><p>- Discharge the fuel supply pressure (see ASSY. 10 - WARNINGS).</p><p>1. Disconnect the fuel supply pipe from the fuel pipe assembly.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections from the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070A</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070B</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070C</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070D</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070E</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070F</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and remove the fuel pipe assembly (3b) complete with injectors (3c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/5887.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[12,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the fuel pipe assembly, complete with injectors, and secure it using the bolts.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Check that the injectors are correctly positioned in their seats.</p></aside><p>- Connect the electrical connections for the injectors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>.</p></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070A</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070B</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070C</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070D</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070E</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/771.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td></td><td><p>Injector</p></td><td><p>N070F</p></td></tr></table></div><p>- Connect the fuel supply pipe to the fuel pipe assembly.</p><p><a href=\"#/187410\">See in Op. 1072B42 INTAKE MANIFOLDS (all) - R.R. and Replace gasket</a></p><p>- Connect the negative battery terminal (-).</p>"]]